
---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="About | Andoni Alcelay"
  description="Professional background, engineering interests and technologies."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-300">ABOUT ME</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
      Engineering, software<br />and problem solving.
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-400">
      <p>
        I'm a software engineer based in Germany, interested in building
        reliable systems, automating complex workflows and solving
        engineering problems through software.
      </p>
      <p>
        My experience spans backend development, software tooling,
        infrastructure and the space sector.
      </p>
      <p>
        I enjoy understanding how systems work, improving existing
        processes and building practical solutions that make a difference.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Technologies</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {["C#", ".NET", "Python", "Java", "TypeScript", "Angular", "SQL", "Docker", "Linux", "Bash"].map((tech) => (
          <span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            {tech}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
